eing driven by the price increases in domestic aviation and how much of an impact from international improvement, and if you can clear, if you can talk about overall, how much has international improved on a Q2 basis?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/makemytrip-mmyt-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMYT 2023 Q1","e":"mmyt","d":"2022-07-27","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Magow","x":"In the next few months as the visa backlog gets cleared, and new visa issuances for European and American destination get streamline, we expect to see stronger demand recovery in these long haul destinations as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2022/07/27/makemytrip-mmyt-q1-2023-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMYT 2026 Q1","e":"mmyt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Magow","x":"And with that same theme, we've seen a lot of promise coming out of Gen AI, and we've been investing significantly behind that, and we will continue to keep investing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/makemytrip-mmyt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMYT 2026 Q1","e":"mmyt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Magow","x":"All of that repository is only going to add more strength to our initiatives for us to be able to just come up with cutting-edge innovation on enhancing the consumer experience, which is one of the main areas where we are sort of investing behind leveraging Gen AI.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/makemytrip-mmyt-q1-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"MMYT 2026 Q1","e":"mmyt","d":"2025-07-22","l":"ai_disruption","r":"management","s":"Rajesh Magow","x":"And we see it more us sort of leading the innovation through Gen AI, rather than overtly getting paranoid about potential disruption.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2025/07/22/makemytrip-mmyt-q1-2026-earnings-call